From: Demo Solution Team <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] sm: preserve asynchronous runtime statuses and current identity

Use the runtime start snapshot without promoting activating to active. Cache
matching notifications, reject superseded version/runtime/digest callbacks,
and retain a callback received during StartInstance instead of overwriting
it with an earlier returned snapshot. Preserve start errors in full status.

Upstream-Status: Pending [32 native launcher tests pass; live qualification pending]
Base: aos_core_lib_cpp 5560291ba6914e36a5b841ade4d8fc54134a9e91

